    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**Available October 15th****Furnished** Sherry FitzGerald Lettings presents this newly spacious two double bedroom, one bathroom apartment extending to approx. 76sqm just off the Sandymount strand. Accommodation in brief consists of entrance hallway leading into open plan living room with bright aspect, with a kitchen, fridge freezer and microwave. The property consists of two double bedrooms, both with ample built in wardrobe space. There is a walk in electric shower bathroom just off the hallway. Viewing highly recommended of this lovely apartment. **Professionally managed by Sherry FitzGerald Lettings**"
      },
